  "markdown": "Reviews\n\n# Feedback from Calico Wallpaper\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n\nTwo notes from Calico Wallpaper, published as written and with permission, beside the installations they refer to.\n\n[Start your project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/) [See the work](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/)\n\nNo review here is written by Mr Wallcover, none is drafted on a client’s behalf, and none is rewarded. UK rules prohibit fake reviews and concealed incentivised reviews; the [CMA explains the UK rules on reviews](https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/reviews-and-social-media-endorsements-what-businesses-and-content-creators-must-know).\n\n## Calico Wallpaper\n\nWe have installed Calico Wallpaper murals and papers at London design weeks, a showroom and a shop, each with its own case study.\n\n“Gorgeous! Thank you so much!”\n\nCalico Wallpaper, on the Beverly 1975 installation\n\n“Thank you for the update Dorin and for your hard work!”\n\nCalico Wallpaper\n\nThe installations are on the [Calico × BEVERLY 1975 case study](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-beverly-1975-cadence/) and the other [work delivered in partnership with Calico Wallpaper](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/#design-weeks).\n\n## On the public record\n\n[![Cadence Oxblood behind BEVERLY 1975's tables during Brompton Design District.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/beverly-08-800.webp)](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-beverly-1975-cadence/)\n\nCadence Oxblood behind BEVERLY 1975's tables during Brompton Design District. Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.\n\n### [Calico Wallpaper x BEVERLY 1975: Cadence at The Lavery, Brompton Design District](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-beverly-1975-cadence/)\n\nWallcovering installation (feature wall), 2026.\n\n[View the project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-beverly-1975-cadence/)\n\n[![The runway set at Rosewood London, ready for the show.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/ahluwalia-estuary-07-800.webp)](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-ahluwalia-estuary-rosewood/)\n\nThe runway set at Rosewood London, ready for the show. Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.\n\n### [Ahluwalia x Calico Wallpaper: 'Estuary' at Rosewood London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-ahluwalia-estuary-rosewood/)\n\nSpecialist installation of the Estuary mural backdrop, against a fixed show deadline, 2026.\n\n[View the project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-ahluwalia-estuary-rosewood/)\n",
